    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "The peer is always 127.0.0.1. bits_per_second is converted to Gb/s. udp_throughput_gbps, udp_jitter_ms, and packet_loss_rate (iperf3 lost_percent, a percent) are filled on the UDP row only, and tcp_retransmit_count on the TCP row only"
